# Pinned ruby-asterism/picoruby-asterism-zenoh: Asterism::Zenoh, the Zenoh
# binding over zenoh-pico (doc/ruby_asterism). Same scheme as ASTERISM_PIN:
# - `rake asterism:setup` clones this exact commit into
#   vendor/picoruby-asterism-zenoh (gitignored); `rake setup` copies the
#   mrbgem into the picoruby submodule.
# - The zenoh-pico release is pinned by that repository (its
#   ZENOH_PICO_PIN); `rake zenoh:setup` reads it from the checkout.
# - Private for now: ssh clone, CI cannot fetch it.
# - PICORUBY_ASTERISM_ZENOH_DIR=<checkout> builds from a working checkout
#   instead (ZENOH_PICO_DIR does the same for zenoh-pico).
# - To update: commit and push its main, put the commit here, run
#   `rake setup` (or any build).
